    "c2634": (greeting: "Greetings, $N."),
    "c2663": (greeting: "Care to purchase some piratey items?"),
    "c2664": (greeting: "Greetings, $N."),
    "c2668": (greeting: "Greetings, $N."),
    "c2669": (greeting: "Greetings, $N."),
    "c2670": (greeting: "Ah, one of my favorite customers. You look to be of a warlock of some power, $N. I am pleased to meet you. If there is anything I can do for you, please, just ask.\n\nMy brother and I feel that it will be your kind who lead us into the next great era. One with such power... such control... it's only a matter of time before the Legion itself bends to your will.\n\nI am but a little envious."),
