    "c3339": (greeting: "Greetings, $N."),
    "c3341": (greeting: "Kneel beside me, friend. I caught a bullet during that last raid.\n\n<Gann grunts in pain as he tries to shift position. His left hand clutches a wound, blood welling between his quivering fingers.>\n\nWhen the dwarves first invaded the Barrens, I contented myself with harassing their diggers and sabotaging their equipment. I should've struck a killing blow when I had the chance."),
