    "c3845": (greeting: "Greetings, $c. Our position here is a bit exposed given the build up of the Horde's forces to the south.\n\nAnything that you can do to help will be greatly appreciated."),
    "c3846": (greeting: "Welcome,  sir . This is a much better camp than the one that I used to have.\n\nIt's good to have company. They've been nice enough to teach me some of their fighting techniques so that I can hold my own against the Horde."),
    "c3847": (greeting: "Greetings, $N."),
    "c3848": (greeting: "It's good to hear the voices of others here in Forest Song again. I'd begun to feel as though I might be the last of the kaldorei ever to set eyes on these lands before their descent into corruption."),
