    "c16283": (greeting: "Greetings, $N."),
    "c16284": (greeting: "Greetings, $N."),
    "c16365": (greeting: "Is this the best they could do?\n\n<Omarion musters the strength to laugh.>\n\nYou do not possess the resolve to face a monster like Kel'Thuzad. You will crumble before his minions - just like those that have come before you...\n\nLeave me here to die. I refuse to return to a world that champions the likes of you."),
    "c16376": (greeting: "Greetings, $N."),
    "c16381": (greeting: "Greetings, $N."),
    "c16399": (greeting: "Greetings, $N."),
